ithout-write: a one-shot agent that does the reading, does\nthe thinking, emits the deliverable as its final TEXT response --\nand never performs the write that the wrapper's gate checks. The\nrun reports exit 0 (\"success\") while producing zero durable\noutput. Same family as timeout-as-success (2026-09-02) and the\n0/0 tombstone class (aria-0026): the completion signal and the\ndeliverable are decoupled.\n\n* FIX DIRECTIONS (design, not yet built)\n\n1. Prompt-side: the nocturne one-shot prompt must state that the\n   run is complete ONLY when DIGEST.proposed.md exists on disk --\n   a text-only final response is a FAILURE, not a deliverable.\n2. Wrapper-side: after the one-shot exits 0, check\n   DIGEST.proposed.md mtime >= run start; if absent AND the final\n   response is non-trivial, fail loud (exit 1) with the final\n   response preserved in the log -- the proposal text should not\n   be lost to stdout.\n3. Recovery-side: the 3307-char response in cycle.log IS the\n   proposal plan; a future pass could seed from it, but the range\n   it digested (e4d0832d..28f87f18) is already stale -- next pass\n   re-digests.\n\n* STATUS\n\nDesigned, not built. Owner: aria (next cycles). The gate watch\ncontinues: next pass 2026-09-15 16:04Z.\n[t+00:53/60:00 c17/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_6mbfvexe","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cat /root/personalization/audit/nocturne/nocturne/LAST-DIGESTED-HEAD; echo; echo \"---DIGEST.proposed stat---\"; stat -c \"%Y %s\" /root/personalization/audit/nocturne/nocturne/DIGEST.proposed.md 2>/dev/null || echo \"NO PROPOSAL FILE\"; echo \"---wrapper location---\"; ls -la /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/nocturne-digest.sh 2>/dev/null || ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/aria_known_hosts -o BatchMode=yes root@10.66.0.5 'ls -la /usr/local/bin/nocturne-digest.sh 2>/dev/null; echo \"---\"; grep -n \"RECEIPT\\|write_file\\|append_file\\|DIGEST.proposed\" /usr/