ork's fixed copy\n(md5 08c2e59b both sides). check-parens OK. .bak dir untouched.\nContainer-local -- re-verify after container rebuild. Sophon side has\nNO elpa gptel dir (fork mount only); continuo's 3f6fd01 pushed to the\nsophon bare repo so her fork mount and bare agree.\n''',\n 'capture-check-elisp-stderr.org': '''\n\n* Resolution (aria c231, 2026-09-22 ~15:10 UTC)\n\nDONE. Commit b6f811e (i.ar main): cl-letf on `message' around\nbyte-compile-file (batch `message' writes to stderr regardless of\nstandard-error binding). Diagnostics land in *Compile-Log* (tool\noutput surface); wrapper stderr clean. Verified broken + clean file.\nSuite 1331/1331.\n'''}\nfor name, add in updates.items():\n    p = os.path.join(base, name)\n    if os.path.exists(p):\n        open(p,'a').write(add)\n        print(f\"updated {name}\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"MISSING {name}\")\nEOF\ncd /root/personalization && git add tasks/iar/aria/iar/fix-stream-abort-stringp-race/ && git commit -m \"fix-stream-abort-stringp-race: all three subtasks resolved (c231)\" 2>&1 | tail -1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[15:09:42] Command exited with code 1.\nOutput:\ncapture-check-elisp-stderr.org\ndescription.org\nrca-and-fix.org\nrepair-elpa-copy.org\nupdated rca-and-fix.org\nupdated repair-elpa-copy.org\nupdated capture-check-elisp-stderr.org\nThe following paths are ignored by one of your .gitignore files:\ntasks/iar\nhint: Use -f if you really want to add them.\nhint: Disable this message with \"git config set advice.addIgnoredFile false\"\n\n[t+11:55/60:00 c213/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_sao9ed9q","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git add knowledge/aria/exit255-stringp-rca-2026-09-22.md && git commit -m \"exit-255 RCA: resolution addendum (c231) -- all three subtasks landed; delegate-abort refinement\" 2>&1 | tail -1; git push origin main 2>&1 | tail -1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[1