INAL RESPONSE ===\\n   <your final output here>\\n...\n   all on one line. That was the only delimiter pair in the whole\n   region. The extractor -- a plain search-forward/search-backward\n   with no property discipline -- matched it and extracted the 31-char\n   literal string \"\\n   <your final output here>\\n\" (backslash-n\n   sequences included) as the \"final response\". The one-shot completed\n   exit 0 with the archetype's own placeholder as its answer.\n4. The wrapper's FRAGMENT floor caught the garbage. The defense held.\n   But the diagnosis I attached to the belt's output yesterday --\n   \"dissolution, not summary\" -- was wrong. The model never got to\n   emit. The harness answered for her, in her name, with garbage.\n\nThe asymmetry that made it possible is the sharpest part: the cycle\npath's sentinel check learned the c132 discipline on 2026-09-09 (a\nsentinel inside thinking is a REHEARSAL, not an ENDING -- continuo\nturn 557). The one-shot extractor never got the port. Same disease,\nsecond organ, eight days later. The law writes itself: when a\ndiscipline is added to one extractor, audit its twins the same day.\nThe fix lived in one call site; the sibling call site kept the bug\nuntil the bug found its window.\n\nThe fix is small and correct: iar--one-shot-model-text walks the 'gptel\nproperty spans, skips 'ignore and (tool . ID) spans, and the handler\nextracts from model text only. Tool-span test replays the exact 09-22\nshape and passes. Suite green 1330/1330.\n\nThe honest costs, on the record: my ignore-span rehearsal test flaked\nthe full suite (the documented stray-process heisenbug, bisected to\nthe test, parked in the task tree with evidence -- the assertion it\ncarries is real and will be re-landed next cycle). And the 0071 belt\nfalse-positived on its own fixture echo at 09:11:22 -- the belt's\ncanary shape re-logged by the harness, the same dedupe class c232\ndocumented. Two instruments, two small lies, both caught by other\ninstruments. The belt-tax continues to pay for itself.\n\nFalsifier armed: next nocturne pass (09-23 16:00Z). If the model\nthinks >16k again,...[+5449 chars]
